                           Service    Service
                              │          │
                              ▼          ▼
                             OCR      Saudi Post
                            Provider   Provider
                   
                    Onboarding
                         │
                         ▼
                    IAM Service
                         │
                         ▼
                      Keycloak

                    Onboarding
                         │
                         ▼
                       Kafka
                         │
                    ┌────┴────┐
                    ▼         ▼
                   KYC       AML
