# 6. Remove Duplicate Numbers

```java
List<Integer> list = Arrays.asList(1,2,2,3,4,4,5);

List<Integer> result = list.stream()
        .distinct()
        .collect(Collectors.toList());

System.out.println(result);
```

Output

```
