        str -> str.length();
```

---

# Consumer vs Predicate

| Consumer | Predicate |
|-----------|-----------|
| Returns Nothing | Returns Boolean |
| Performs Action | Checks Condition |
| accept() | test() |

Consumer:

```java
Consumer<String> print =
        System.out::println;
```

Predicate:

```java
Predicate<Integer> even =
        n -> n % 2 == 0;
```

---

# Consumer vs Supplier

| Consumer | Supplier |
|-----------|-----------|
| Input Required | No Input |
| No Output | Output Returned |

Consumer:

```java
Consumer<String> print =
        System.out::println;
```

Supplier:

```java
Supplier<String> s =
        () -> "Hello";
```

