# Function Composition

Very Important Interview Topic

Function provides:

```java
andThen()
compose()
```

---

## andThen()

First execute current function.

Then execute next function.

```java
Function<Integer,Integer> multiplyBy2 =
        n -> n * 2;

Function<Integer,Integer> add10 =
        n -> n + 10;

Function<Integer,Integer> result =
        multiplyBy2.andThen(add10);

System.out.println(
        result.apply(5)
);
```

Execution:

```text
5
|
*2
|
10
|
+10
|
20
```

Output:

```text
20
```

---

## compose()

Reverse order.

```java
Function<Integer,Integer> multiplyBy2 =
        n -> n * 2;

Function<Integer,Integer> add10 =
        n -> n + 10;

Function<Integer,Integer> result =
        multiplyBy2.compose(add10);

System.out.println(
        result.apply(5)
);
```

Execution:

```text
5
|
+10
|
15
|
*2
|
30
```

Output:

```text
30
```

