# 28. How do you test FastAPI APIs?

I''d use `pytest` along with FastAPI''s testing utilities / HTTP client approach.

Tests could cover:

```text
Unit Tests
   ↓
Service logic

API Tests
   ↓
Endpoints

Integration Tests
   ↓
API + DB / external integrations
```

Example:

```python
def test_get_user():
