If you''re preparing for a **Python Full Stack interview with ~3 years'' experience**, decorators are definitely a topic worth knowing beyond just the basic definition—especially **`@wraps`, `*args/**kwargs`, closures, multiple decorators, and Flask/FastAPI usage**.', 'python,fastapi,asyncio'),
