### Step 3

Spring Boot reads:

```text
META-INF/spring/org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure.AutoConfiguration.imports
```

(Spring Boot 3.x)

or

```text
META-INF/spring.factories
```

(Spring Boot 2.x)

This file contains a list of auto-configuration classes.

Examples:

```java
