# Memory Trick

```text
@EnableAutoConfiguration
        ↓
Check Dependencies
        ↓
Load Auto Config Classes
        ↓
Check Conditions
        ↓
Create Beans
        ↓
Application Ready
```

### One-Line Formula

> **Dependency Present → Auto Configuration Loaded → Conditions Checked → Beans Created** 🚀

