# Startup Flow

```text
Main Method
    ↓
SpringApplication.run()
    ↓
Create ApplicationContext
    ↓
Component Scan
    ↓
Auto Configuration
    ↓
Bean Creation
    ↓
Dependency Injection
    ↓
