# Q1 — Concurrent Identity Verification + Idempotency + Database Concurrency

## Scenario

Two requests A and B simultaneously call:

```text
POST /onboarding/101/identity-verification
````

Current state:

```text
ONB-101 → MOBILE_VERIFIED
```

Requirement:

