## Spring Singleton Thread Safety

```text
@Service
→ Singleton by default

Singleton
≠
Not thread-safe

Problem:
Shared mutable instance state

Good:
Stateless service
+
local variables
+
final dependencies

final
≠
automatically thread-safe
